              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye abu kaany ebe mam iswamat akirot naibusakinitor atwanare; ŋes da elopet iyatakinit mama ejai Kaisar, abu kaomite aijukar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eoŋ da emamei akirot nakabeit naewadikakini ejakait. Kanuka ŋun ayau ŋes ne akonyenekus, aitelekarit akonyenekon, wu Ekabaka Agiripa, tetere kidau aiŋitiŋit kadum akirot naewadikai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
